  "question": {
    "text": "A focus of an ellipse is at the origin. The directrix is the line $x=4$ and the eccentricity is $1 / 2$. Then the length of the semi-major axis is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "lPfbM",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{8}{3}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "h9to4",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{2}{3}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "BAyZ6",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{4}{3}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "saC2v",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{5}{3}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Major axis is along $x$-axis.\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\frac{a}{e}-a e=4 \\\\\n& a\\left(2-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)=4 \\\\\n& a=\\frac{8}{3} .\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
